#
# Config for the auxiliary Docker stack (Mosquitto + OpenMowerApp).
#
# This is NOT where open_mower_ros itself is configured -- that stack runs
# via systemd-nspawn and reads /data/openmower/openmower.conf instead (see
# README's "Configuration" section).
#
# ----- Internal do not touch -----
#
# Static for now (only feeds Dockge's displayed link for this stack, not
# functional) -- no systemd unit drives `docker compose up` for this stack
# anymore to rewrite it per-boot, since it's started explicitly via
# openmower-cli instead. Revisit if that CLI update wants to keep it fresh.
HOSTNAME="openmower.local"
